---
// Hanko seal reading スルタン (Sultan), set vertically.
// The katakana are outlines from Noto Serif JP Black (SIL Open Font License),
// converted to paths, so no Japanese font is loaded. The ink texture and uneven
// edges come from the #hanko-ink filter. Color follows var(--accent) via currentColor.
// The stamp animation is styled in global.css; the script below triggers it.
---

